      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "JER",
          "chapter": 17,
          "verse": 23
        }
      ],
      "en": "But they didn’t listen. They didn’t turn their ear, but made their neck stiff, that they might not hear, and might not receive instruction.",
      "ko": "그들은 청종치 아니하며 귀를 기울이지 아니하며 그 목을 곧게 하여 듣지 아니하며 교훈을 받지 아니하였느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "7c5334e7391839c5a95739a454cd226a72495253181955bb8da7236be4014133",
      "translation_text_hash": "5b8ecc5f2b32e1478aa5500b72603aaa598d78800fef4ee9064d9d59a5130511",
